*.pdf
*.docx
_OM*_full.txt
_pilot_manuals/
_mazda_manuals/

# ── Misplaced clone + independently-deployed demo projects (0 tracked files each) ──
UsersRobertreposskills/
kyr-military-demo/
kyr-af-demo/

